        "source": "Apple Machine Learning Research",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-13T02:48:13.955Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Minions enables teams to leverage existing hardware without requiring additional GPU procurement.",
